OL,3,GNEWSAAmber alert as Scotland faces
OL,4,Ablood donation shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amber alert has come into force for
OL,7,Fthe first time as stocks of blood in
OL,8,FScotland have dropped to unprecedented
OL,9,Flow levels due to the shortage of
OL,10,Fdonors.
OL,12,FThe warning has been sent to hospitals
OL,13,Facross the country by the Scottish
OL,14,FNational Blood Transfusion Service
OL,15,F(SNBTS), urging medical staff to only
OL,16,Fuse Type O blood when essential.
OL,18,FType O blood is particularly important
OL,19,Ffor transfusions as O-negative acts as
OL,20,Fa universal donor and O-positive is the
OL,21,Fmost common blood type in the UK, with
OL,22,Fabout 35% of the population having it.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
