OL,3,GNEWSAAmber alert as Scotland faces
OL,4,Ablood donation shortages
OL,5,
OL,6,FStocks have consistently been below
OL,7,Ftarget levels for several weeks and
OL,8,FGroup O blood has fallen to below two
OL,9,Fdays of reserves on several occasions
OL,10,Frecently.
